
ADICIONE estes scripts ao seu package.json existente:

"scripts": {
  ...seus scripts existentes...,
  "seed:deliveries": "tsx prisma/seed-deliveries.ts",
  "clear:deliveries": "tsx prisma/clear-deliveries.ts"
}

Exemplo completo:
{
  "scripts": {
    "dev": "next dev",
    "build": "prisma generate && next build",
    "start": "node prisma/check-seed.js && next start",
    "prisma:generate": "prisma generate",
    "prisma:migrate": "prisma migrate deploy",
    "prisma:seed": "tsx prisma/seed.ts",
    "seed:deliveries": "tsx prisma/seed-deliveries.ts",
    "clear:deliveries": "tsx prisma/clear-deliveries.ts"
  }
}
